</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
The factor of the malfunction can be checked in “Data List” of SUZUKI scan tool. (except parameters related to steering angle sensor and ESP<sup>&#174;</sup> system)
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention3>
